  "description": "The TWO15 Race is designed to tweak the laws of physics in your favour, so you can let gravity work its magic. Featuring the iconic RockShox Boxxer Select fork with 200mm travel for the ultimate in handling and control, we paired this boulder-muncher with a RockShox Vivid Select shock at the rear – and there's loads of frame adjustability, so you can set up the progression and handling to your liking. Newmen's tough Performance 30 wheelset with Continental Kryptotal 2.4in tyres, paired with powerful Sram Maven Base hydraulic disc brakes, work together to help you keep the rubber side down. And Sram's GX DH gearset gets your power down to the trail with reliable shifting and just the right range of ratios.",
